
# <type>(<scope>): <summary in imperative mood, max 72 chars>
#
# Why this change is needed, and anything a reviewer should know.
# Wrap at 72 characters. Leave the body out for trivial changes.
#
# types:  feat     new capability (a page, a block, a build feature)
#         fix      a bug fix
#         content  text, images or projects under content/
#         style    CSS or templates, no behaviour change
#         refactor code change with no behaviour change
#         test     tests only
#         ci       .github/, wrangler.jsonc, deploy
#         docs     README, comments
#         chore    dependencies, tooling
#
# scopes: content, build, imaging, markdown, css, templates, ci, deploy
#
# Enable once per clone:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
